 "statement": "Ten named Lean endpoints establish only numeric model and integer instances: the four-summand gamma=1/2 saturated-yield rational envelope has minimum4/9 at beta2/9; the six-summand gamma=3/2 envelope has minimum5/12 at beta1/6, while its naive unsaturated balance beta2/11 evaluates to5/11. Both model minima are less than1/2. Four Core inequalities establish the actual scalar-order floor sixth root2^42, and that the current claimed class lower bound has fifth and sixth powers above that scalar-order integer. The maintained gate audits12 declarations with zero trusted-native exceptions; only the ten named endpoints are claimed. No actual algorithm cost, yield/distribution, point count, growing-family admissibility or attack exponent follows. Complete source files and dependency manifest are pinned in addition to declaration bindings."
